    "detailed_description": "<strong>Story</strong><br>2018, the world of after a lapse of eight years from the faith collapse.<br>Three young sorcerers belonging to the Ministry of Defense Special Armed Forces-Michiharu Yoshimuro, Kazuya Inaba, and Mizuki Kurauchi were tasked with resolving the square-related cases that occurred around the same time.<br>As they perform their duties, the members will remember their own past and face it again.<br>On the other hand, the Special Armed Forces Headquarters found a strange common point in each mission--<br><br>The first game of Sorcerer\u2019s Records Series Season 3 is here!<br>Check out the story of Sorcerer's Records, which is more mature than ever!<br><br><strong>Introduction</strong><br>This game is a standard lower window novel game for men of all ages.<br>The scenario itself is a straight road, but it branches into three routes depending on the character's point of view.<br><br><strong>Attention</strong><br>Please note that if the game is updated, the previous save data may not be available.",
